				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12003227#post-4267513</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12003227/scp-4297-j#post-4267513</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2019 20:36:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>devonmartin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1985558</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <h1><span>Go read <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4297">SCP-4297</a> first, if you haven't already!</span></h1> <p>This is my fourth article, based on the mainlist SCP of the same number. Kind of.</p> <p>Incidentally, I published this within 24 hours of publishing the main one. Two skips in one day! (According to some more experienced authors, this is the first time anyone's published a mainlist scip and its -J in such a short time&#8230; cool!) (Sorry for the brag.)</p> <p>Thanks to Crashington and TheBlueHour for looking through my draft on such short notice. No rush on the next one, eh?</p> <p>Image licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0, source <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Dromaius_novaehollandiae#/media/File:Emu_at_the_Louisville_Zoo.jpg">here</a>.</p> <p>(If you're confused by the last footnote: What does 05-13-21 spell if A=1, B=2, etc.?)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
